# Check text files out with LF line endings on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# The repository stores LF, and Prettier (`npm run format:check`, run in CI) requires it. With
# core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows default, files were checked out as CRLF, so the format
# check failed on every file on Windows. The bash test scripts also need LF to run at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
